","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/commits/783ccdede9e2b23531724c552e873182540e3c1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:22:49Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:22:49Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v10.3.6\n\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: `Router.doNavigate` wrote the ID into the URL hash as it was, while `Router.getLocation` reads the hash by splitting it at \"/\" and decoding every part. An ID that contains a \"/\" - e.g. `ocpp.0./TACW1142021G1543.1.meterValues.Power_Active_Import` - was therefore cut off at its first slash on the way back, and its remainder landed in `arg`. The ID segment is URL-encoded now, so it survives the round trip, including the one a dialog makes when it only changes its tab (ioBroker.admin#3634). **Callers must pass the raw ID**: one that is already encoded is now encoded twice\n- (@GermanBluefox) Changed: without the expert mode, the object browser no longer offers to delete an object of an adapter - neither the button in the row nor the entry in the context menu nor the `Delete` key. Deleting such an object can stop the adapter from working, and it is created again on the next start anyway. What a user creates themselves (`0_userdata.*`, `alias.*`) can still be deleted without the expert mode, and with the expert mode everything can be deleted as before (ioBroker.admin#3639)\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: the object browser threw `can''t access property \"<id>\", this.objects is undefined` when a navigation target reached it before the object tree was read - which is what a route in the URL does. Such a target now waits for the tree instead of crashing the browser (ioBroker.admin#3634)","tree":{"sha":"e0a8c9c71c3dd556813d6cacfd9f72f179f415c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/git/trees/e0a8c9c71c3dd556813d6cacfd9f72f179f415c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/git/commits/783ccdede9e2b23531724c552e873182540e3c1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/commit/783ccdede9e2b23531724c552e873182540e3c1d","node_id":"C_kwDOQH8KStoAKDc4M2NjZGVkZTllMmIyMzUzMTcyNGM1NTJlODczMTgyNTQwZTNjMWQ