fox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/commits/3415ca899be47040e5fd791eab97df7d34bc69c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:38:57Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:38:57Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v10.3.3\n\n- (@krobipd) Improved: the object browser renders the rows around the visible area instead of every open row of the tree. Selecting a row, applying a filter or folding a node rebuilt every open row, and that cost grows with the size of the tree: measured with 4003 rows open, one click on a row blocked the main thread for 3.9 seconds and a filter for 2.6 seconds - with 603 rows it was 0.4 seconds each. Now it is 0 ms in both cases, and the table holds 38 rows instead of 4003 (1985 instead of 164652 DOM nodes). Scrolling, scrolling to a row and the keyboard navigation reach every row as before\n- (@krobipd) Improved: a value that changes no longer rebuilds every open row of the object browser. Until now one state answered with a render of the whole table, and with a few hundred rows open that blocked the main thread for about a fifth of a second per value - on an installation whose adapters report all the time the table never stood still. A row is kept as it is unless its own state changed or something happened that concerns every row (filter, columns, theme, selection, a rebuilt tree). Measured in the admin with 542 open rows and ten state changes: 1937 ms of blocked main thread before, none after, with the new values shown in every case","tree":{"sha":"754fefa31c735eed0c206011c2bcdfd36b3c86bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/git/trees/754fefa31c735eed0c206011c2bcdfd36b3c86bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/git/commits/3415ca899be47040e5fd791eab97df7d34bc69c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/commit/3415ca899be47040e5fd791eab97df7d34bc69c2","node_id":"C_kwDOQH8KStoAKDM0MTVjYTg5OWJlNDcwNDBlNWZkNzkxZWFiOTdkZjdkMzRiYzY5YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/commit/b04d9e4f46c43de4b2de396f2b2e56ad970fbfd6","sha":"b04d9e4f46c43de4b2de396f2b2e56ad970fbfd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/adapter-react-v5/commits/b04d9e4f46c