04647ec9f75227ed53c83a0e70d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31736309?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CarlosAlbertoR","id":31736309,"login":"CarlosAlbertoR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzM2MzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosAlbertoR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CarlosAlbertoR/customers-mf-angular/commits/5b324b543eceb3b1c912b962b4336d4560f37502/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-25T07:40:54Z","email":"carlosalbertorios3@gmail.com","name":"CRDEV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-25T07:40:54Z","email":"carlosalbertorios3@gmail.com","name":"CRDEV"},"message":"feat: Refactor Customer Service for improved state management and error handling\n\n- Updated API URL for customer service to point to the correct JSON server endpoint.\n- Replaced HttpClient injection in the constructor with the inject() function for better dependency management.\n- Enhanced error handling and loading state management across load, create, update, and delete customer operations.\n- Improved signal usage for reactive state management of customers and loading states.\n\nchore: Update main entry point for Angular microfrontend\n\n- Added zone.js import and wrapped bootstrap logic in a try-catch block for better error handling.\n\nfeat: Implement bootstrap logic for Angular microfrontend\n\n- Created a new bootstrap function for Angular microfrontend with enhanced error handling and rendering checks.\n- Added fallback UI for rendering issues during the bootstrap process.\n\nfeat: Create entry point for microfrontend with Zone.js support\n\n- Introduced a new entry point for the Angular microfrontend that utilizes Zone.js for change detection.\n- Implemented a standalone component for customer management with loading and error states.\n\nstyle: Enhance styling for microfrontend components\n\n- Improved CSS styles for better visual presentation and responsiveness of the microfrontend.\n\nfix: Adjust Module Federation configuration for shared dependencies\n\n- Updated Module Federation configuration to ensure proper sharing of Angular and React dependencies.\n- Ensured singleton instances for shared libraries to prevent version conflicts.\n\nchore: Add TypeScript definitions for microfrontend modules\n\n- Created TypeScript declaration files for the customers microfrontend to improve type safety and IDE support.\n\nfix: Update shell application styles and structure\n\n- Refactored shell application styles for better layout and responsiveness.\n- Simplified the structure of the shell application to enhance maintainability.\n\nfeat: Implement loading and error handling in CustomersMF component\n\n- Enhanced the CustomersMF component to manage loading states and display error messages effectively.\n- Added detailed troubleshooting steps for users in case of loading failures.","tree":{"sha":"9b4ea19cd07763d2ece3ad1b278994eb716c3867","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CarlosAlbertoR/customers-mf-angular/git/trees/9b4ea19cd07763d2ece3ad1b278994eb716c3867"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CarlosAlbertoR/customers-mf-angular/git/commits/5b324b543eceb3b1c912b962b4336d4560f37502","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",