l for system-db and store-db\n- Added 2 default users (admin/user) with BCrypt passwords\n- Included 8 sample products across categories\n- Added database/README.md with setup instructions\n\nEnvironment Configuration:\n- Use environment variables for sensitive data\n- Updated .env.example with placeholder values (no real secrets)\n- Modified application.yml to use env vars: GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, JWT_SECRET, DB_USERNAME, DB_PASSWORD\n- Created ENV_SETUP.md with comprehensive configuration guide\n\nDocumentation:\n- Renamed README_GITHUB.md to README.md\n- Enhanced README with step-by-step setup instructions\n- Added troubleshooting sections","tree":{"sha":"581bd58316c1d1cd692da0861fd9cff253042abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iLuminase/PetStore-2025-final/git/trees/581bd58316c1d1cd692da0861fd9cff253042abd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iLuminase/PetStore-2025-final/git/commits/9b3360ede2f8d7b2d4683985bea13e0e648fc83e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130492406?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iLuminase","id":130492406,"login":"iLuminase","node_id":"U_kgDOB8cn9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iLuminase","user