tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/commits/cb9eb7b0a8cac1f71cd8e9bc9d96c4b60ad55301/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-24T17:01:54Z","email":"maudmcok001@gmail.com","name":"maudmcok"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-24T17:01:54Z","email":"maudmcok001@gmail.com","name":"maudmcok"},"message":"Add advanced admin and monitoring views\n\nComplete the Vue 3 frontend with sophisticated admin panels and monitoring dashboards.\n\nNew Views:\n1. ProjectDetailView:\n   - Video player with HTML5 controls\n   - Real-time transcription display\n   - Clickable timestamps (seek to time)\n   - Processing metrics (time, cost, speedup)\n   - Export transcription (TXT, SRT, VTT)\n   - Worker type indicator (CPU/GPU)\n   - Auto-polling for status updates\n\n2. AdminView (Configuration):\n   - Routing strategy selector (Local/Hybrid/GCP)\n   - GCP GPU enable/disable toggle\n   - Video duration threshold slider (hybrid mode)\n   - Whisper model selection (tiny to large-v2)\n   - Real-time cost estimation\n   - Savings calculator vs full GCP\n   - Model comparison (size, time, accuracy)\n   - Interactive UI with Tailwind transitions\n\n3. AdminDashboardView:\n   - Real-time statistics (total, completed, processing, failed)\n   - Worker distribution (CPU vs GPU usage)\n   - Performance metrics (avg time, total cost)\n   - System health indicators\n   - Recent activity feed\n   - Quick actions panel\n   - Auto-refresh every 10s\n\n4. PerformanceView:\n   - CPU vs GPU comparison\n   - Recent metrics table\n   - Cost analysis (total, breakdown)\n   - Performance analysis (speedup, time saved)\n   - Time range selector (24h, 7d, 30d, all)\n   - Visual progress bars\n   - Efficiency indicators\n\nFeatures:\n✅ Complete admin control panel\n✅ Hybrid configuration management\n✅ Real-time performance monitoring\n✅ Cost optimization tools\n✅ Video player with transcription sync\n✅ Export capabilities\n✅ Responsive design throughout\n✅ Auto-polling for live updates\n✅ Beautiful gradient cards\n✅ Interactive toggles and sliders\n\nUX Enhancements:\n- Visual feedback for all actions\n- Loading states everywhere\n- Error handling with user-friendly messages\n- Confirmation dialogs for destructive actions\n- Keyboard navigation support\n- Mobile-responsive layouts\n\nNext: Docker configuration and integration\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51b4908583d3c251bf4e37ced46bd6de7f20a31d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/git/trees/51b4908583d3c251bf4e37ced46bd6de7f20a31d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/git/commits/cb9eb7b0a8cac1f71cd8e9bc9d96c4b60ad55301","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7194288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maudmcok","id":7194288,"login":"maudmcok","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTQyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/commit/cb9eb7b0a8cac1f71cd8e9bc9d96c4b60ad55301","node_id":"C_kwDOQIc1-doAKGNiOWViN2IwYThjYWMxZjcxY2Q4ZTliYzlkOTZjNGI2MGFkNTUzMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/commit/a10c5a86747f7ccb56296ccac72b2d7a122fc92f","sha":"a10c5a86747f7ccb56296ccac72b2d7a122fc92f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/commits/a10c5a86747f7ccb56296ccac72b2d7a122fc92f"}],"sha":"cb9eb7b0a8cac1f71cd8e9bc9d96c4b60ad55301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/commits/cb9eb7b0a8cac1f71cd8e9bc9d96c4b60ad55301"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7194288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maudmcok","id":7194288,"login":"maudmcok","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTQyODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maudmcok","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/commits/a10c5a86747f7ccb56296ccac72b2d7a122fc92f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-24T16:57:52Z","email":"maudmcok001@gmail.com","name":"maudmcok"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-24T16:57:52Z","email":"maudmcok001@gmail.com","name":"maudmcok"},"message":"Add Vue 3 frontend with core features\n\nInitialize complete Vue 3 + Vite + TypeScript frontend with Tailwind CSS.\n\nCore Features Implemented:\n- Vue 3 Composition API with TypeScript\n- Vite for ultra-fast build and HMR\n- Tailwind CSS for modern styling\n- Pinia for state management\n- Vue Router with authentication guards\n- Keycloak OAuth2 integration\n\nServices Layer:\n- API service with Axios (interceptors, auth)\n- Keycloak service (login, logout, token refresh)\n- Projects service (CRUD, upload, transcription)\n\nStores (Pinia):\n- Auth store: User authentication and roles\n- Projects store: Project management with real-time polling\n- Config store: System configuration (admin)\n\nViews Created:\n- HomeView: Landing page with features showcase\n- LoginView: Keycloak authentication\n- UploadView: Drag-and-drop video upload with progress tracking\n- ProjectsView: List all projects with real-time status updates\n- NotFoundView: 404 error page\n\nComponents:\n- NavBar: Navigation with user menu\n- Footer: Application footer\n\nFeatures:\n✅ Drag-and-drop video upload\n✅ Real-time upload progress tracking\n✅ Project status monitoring (polling every 5s)\n✅ Worker type display (CPU vs GPU)\n✅ Role-based access control (admin routes)\n✅ Responsive design (mobile-first)\n✅ TypeScript type safety throughout\n\nConfiguration:\n- Vite proxy to backend API (192.168.1.23:8080)\n- Environment variables for Keycloak and API\n- Tailwind with custom primary colors\n- Auto-refresh JWT tokens\n\nNext Steps:\n- ProjectDetailView (video player + transcription display)\n- AdminView (hybrid/GCP configuration)\n- AdminDashboardView (stats and metrics)\n- PerformanceView (performance monitoring)\n- Dockerfile + nginx config\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0cf2d78fafd91f10bb5cb411a0950647f8d8958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-platform/git/trees/d0cf2d78fafd91f10bb5cb411a0950647f8d8958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maudmcok/video-ai-pla