"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xkazm04/story/commits/956f67c7aa4128fa0a71d70b323483b650d52bf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T21:57:59Z","email":"michal.kazdan@borndigital.ai","name":"kazimi66"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T21:57:59Z","email":"michal.kazdan@borndigital.ai","name":"kazimi66"},"message":"V2 workspace panels, creator migration, and CLI enhancements\n\n- Add 15 workspace panels (ArtStyle, Beats, CharacterCreator, CharacterDetail,\n  ImageGenerator, SceneList, ScriptEditor, StoryEvaluator, StoryGraph,\n  ThemeManager, VoiceCasting, VoiceManager, WritingDesk, etc.)\n- Migrate creator from (experimental) to features/v2/creator with image gen\n- Add intent detection hook and workspace store improvements\n- Update panel registry, layout engine, and skill panel configs\n- Clean up deleted experimental creator files and goals.db\n- Update .gitignore with dist/ and nul exclusions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0fe430fdd8c80415bca2b3195cdd79761ce374b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xkazm04/story/git/trees/a0fe430fdd8c80415bca2b3195cdd79761ce374b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xkazm04/story/git/commits/956f67c7aa4128fa0a71d70b323483b650d52bf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238988060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/following{/other_user}","gists_u