criptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kazimi66","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xkazm04/story/commits/64d8e16e49c50b987c0e3d65f0eeb7c6ddbd1def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T13:11:06Z","email":"michal.kazdan@borndigital.ai","name":"kazimi66"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T13:11:06Z","email":"michal.kazdan@borndigital.ai","name":"kazimi66"},"message":"Add V2 dynamic workspace + CLI migration + UI component library\n\nMajor milestone combining three bodies of work:\n\nV2 Dynamic Workspace (new):\n- CLI-driven workspace with terminal dock and dynamic panel grid\n- 6 scene panels (editor, characters, story map, metadata, dialogue, image)\n- CSS Grid layout engine with 6 presets (auto-resolves from panel count)\n- Skill panelConfig for immediate panel setup on CLI execution\n- update_workspace MCP tool for LLM-driven panel control\n- Terminal dock with tabbed sessions, collapse/expand, keyboard shortcuts\n- Bi-directional: panels trigger CLI skills, CLI populates panels\n- v1/v2 toggle in header with localStorage persistence\n\nCLI Migration (completed):\n- 28 skills across 7 domains replacing direct LLM API calls\n- MCP server with 24 tools for Story data access\n- CompactTerminal with SSE streaming, RAF-batched rendering\n- CLI session store with persistence and recovery\n- useCLIFeature integration hook with query invalidation\n- Removed: useLLM, LLM types, contextGathering, src/prompts/\n\nUI Polish:\n- New reusable components (Tabs, Badge, Skeleton, FilterBar, etc.)\n- cn() migration across all features\n- Zustand store migration for feature-local state\n- Fix infinite render loop in AppShellHeader (stable selectors)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b074d2ae647439ad04dfc59287b8889715cf84e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xkazm04/story/git/trees/2b074d2ae647439ad04