ly.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix: Resolve build errors and finalize test setup\n\nThis commit addresses the CI build failure by correcting the Babel configuration for Jest and fixing a pre-existing TypeScript error.\n\n- The Babel configuration is now handled directly within jest.config.cjs to avoid conflicts with the Next.js build process.\n- A TypeScript type error in twitter-adapter.ts has been resolved.\n\nWith these changes, the build completes successfully and all tests pass as expected, finalizing the initial test implementation.","tree":{"sha":"b85c73ed2ddea126cb4d5523c4afcb39eec00529","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/trees/b85c73ed2ddea126cb4d5523c4afcb39eec00529"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/commits/4481c758dfdc52a792aa392d0087639886c6b89f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscription