}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/commits/e234b1f27e7c96797c7fc8f9e866519f693ed5a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T02:34:25Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T02:34:25Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: Restore E2E test scripts to a stable configuration\n\nThis change reverts the diagnostic modifications made to the `start` and `test:e2e` scripts in `package.json` and restores them to a standard, simplified configuration.\n\nThe previous attempts to debug the CI environment led to a complex and fragile setup. After returning to a simpler configuration, the E2E tests were successfully validated in a local environment, confirming that the base setup is solid and works as expected. This provides a stable foundation for future E2E test development.","tree":{"sha":"8409b0ee53f00c5c70f4dcf87e8e80d607bb2961","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/trees/8409b0ee53f00c5c70f4dcf87e8e80d607bb2961"},"url":"https://api