2f2722a03ab7354d28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T20:03:24Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T20:03:24Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Implement native on-ramp journey with OpenSea API\n\nImplements a comprehensive, three-step on-ramp journey for new users, featuring a native NFT purchase experience.\n\n- Replaces the previous iframe-based OpenSea integration with a secure, API-driven flow. A new backend API endpoint (`/api/opensea`) uses the `opensea-js` SDK to fetch listings and prepare transactions, preventing any exposure of API keys on the client-side.\n- The frontend `BuyNftStep` component is refactored to display NFT data natively and execute the purchase by calling the backend API, providing a seamless user experience.\n- Step 1 integrates the Ramp Network SDK for fiat-to-ETH purchases on the Base network.\n- Step 2 uses `ethers.js` for direct interaction with the Uniswap V2 router for ETH-to-$NATION token swaps.\n- Includes on-chain verification of NFT ownership after the purchase transaction is confirmed.\n- Adds Jest tests for the main `OnRamp` state machine component to ensure flow logic is correct.\n- Cleans up unused CSS files from the previous iframe implementation.","tree":{"sha":"37d15be44cb2c327285d15e3c8c0fe3626fba581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/trees/37d15be44cb2c327285d15e3c8c0fe3626fba581"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/commits/058d8f840a7b6c413c689c2f2722a03ab7354d28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http