google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Implement Phase 1 of documentation overhaul\n\nThis commit establishes the foundational structure for the new, user-centric documentation as outlined in Phase 1 of the organization plan.\n\nKey changes include:\n- Replaced the existing README.md with a new version focused on the platform''s value proposition.\n- Added a CONTRIBUTING.md with guidelines tailored for the Next.js development environment.\n- Created a standard CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md to foster a welcoming community.\n- Implemented GitHub issue templates for bug reports, feature requests, and user feedback.\n- Established the new directory structure for docs, examples, and tests.\n- Created placeholder files for future documentation to prevent broken links in the README.","tree":{"sha":"3802fd2e97795d074fcdacf9f0c4a0d1dc89aa41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/trees/3802fd2e97795d074fcdacf9f0c4a0d1dc89aa41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/commits/cb7824623fa98f1be976086b44363a1b4c1020b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repo