te":"2025-11-15T13:19:32Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Configura hook de pre-push confiável e relatório de CI\n\n- Instala `husky`, `start-server-and-test` e `cucumber-html-reporter`.\n- Configura o Husky com um hook de `pre-push` que executa testes E2E antes de enviar para a branch `main`.\n- Adiciona um script `test:e2e` que constrói a aplicação e executa testes contra um servidor de produção estável.\n- Cria um script `generate-report` para gerar relatórios de teste HTML a partir dos resultados do Cucumber.\n- Atualiza o workflow do GitHub Actions (`ci.yml`) para gerar e implantar o relatório de teste no GitHub Pages após um push bem-sucedido para `main`.\n- Adiciona o diretório `reports/` ao `.gitignore` para evitar o versionamento de artefatos de teste.","tree":{"sha":"e1592f30d3fd72a945d624fb3ea996bc2d7ebb75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/trees/e1592f30d3fd72a945d624fb3ea996bc2d7ebb75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/nation.fun/git/commits/2c98cb73b7d46c63720535402afb71889c7a246b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_e